# Vulnerabilities let through the scans (SC1, tools/cmd/vulngate, docs/operator/10-security.md):
# one per line,
#
#   <id> <until YYYY-MM-DD> <reason>
#
# <id> is the scanner's ID or one of its aliases (CVE-…, GHSA-…, GO-…). <until> is at most 90 days
# ahead; an expired exception fails every scan until it is removed or renewed with a new reason.
# The reason says why the vulnerability does not reach Sard or what waits for the fix, and is
# reviewed in the PR like code.
